299
00:08:34,002 --> 00:08:35,302
paid for by workers,

300
00:08:35,342 --> 00:08:37,062
employers and the state.

301
00:08:37,292 --> 00:08:39,912
America followed in 1935.

302
00:08:40,102 --> 00:08:40,822
At the signing,

303
00:08:40,862 --> 00:08:41,922
President Franklin

304
00:08:41,962 --> 00:08:43,572
Roosevelt said why.

305
00:08:44,022 --> 00:08:46,762
Young people have come to wonder

306
00:08:46,802 --> 00:08:48,772
what would be their lot

307
00:08:48,812 --> 00:08:51,042
when they came to old age.

308
00:08:51,082 --> 00:08:53,742
The man with a job has wondered

309
00:08:53,782 --> 00:08:56,332
how long the job would last.

310
00:08:56,752 --> 00:08:58,942
His answer wasn't a promise.

311
00:08:59,012 --> 00:09:00,222
It was a law.

312
00:09:00,352 --> 00:09:02,062
With amounts, with dates,

313
00:09:02,102 --> 00:09:03,092
and with money set

314
00:09:03,132 --> 00:09:04,402
aside years before

315
00:09:04,442 --> 00:09:06,002
the first monthly check.

316
00:09:06,332 --> 00:09:08,752
Then one winter, a retired woman

317
00:09:08,792 --> 00:09:11,012
in Vermont opened her mailbox.

318
00:09:11,322 --> 00:09:12,812
Ida May Fuller.

319
00:09:12,872 --> 00:09:14,122
Check number one.

320
00:09:14,392 --> 00:09:15,342
She kept getting them

321
00:09:15,382 --> 00:09:16,912
until she was a hundred.

322
00:09:17,062 --> 00:09:18,982
Not because someone was generous.

323
00:09:19,022 --> 00:09:20,792
Because the law said so.

324
00:09:21,182 --> 00:09:23,312
Even this law needs repairs.

325
00:09:23,352 --> 00:09:24,742
Unless Congress acts,

326
00:09:24,782 --> 00:09:25,642
Social Security

327
00:09:25,682 --> 00:09:26,722
checks will shrink

328
00:09:26,762 --> 00:09:28,432
in the early 2030s.

329
00:09:28,572 --> 00:09:30,622
Shrink, not stop.

330
00:09:30,762 --> 00:09:32,012
That's the difference.

331
00:09:32,212 --> 00:09:33,912
A promise can be kept.

332
00:09:34,032 --> 00:09:35,904
A law has to be.

333
00:09:36,484 --> 00:09:37,894
If machines really do

334
00:09:37,934 --> 00:09:39,194
take over the work,

335
00:09:39,264 --> 00:09:40,414
an income from all

336
00:09:40,454 --> 00:09:41,984
that abundance only counts

337
00:09:42,024 --> 00:09:44,174
once it's built the same way.

338
00:09:44,374 --> 00:09:46,304
A right, written down,

339
00:09:46,344 --> 00:09:48,574
paid for before you need it.

340
00:09:48,804 --> 00:09:50,354
The day you stop working:

341
00:09:50,514 --> 00:09:52,234
a check in your mailbox.

342
00:09:52,394 --> 00:09:54,544
Not because a forecast came true.

343
00:09:54,654 --> 00:09:56,354
Because a law says so.

344
00:09:56,634 --> 00:09:58,654
That law doesn't exist yet.

345
00:09:58,774 --> 00:09:59,734
Writing it is up

346
00:09:59,774 --> 00:10:01,784
to voters and lawmakers.

347
00:10:02,924 --> 00:10:04,284
The five lines, then.

348
00:10:04,664 --> 00:10:06,564
One, on its way.

349
00:10:06,814 --> 00:10:08,464
One, half true.

350
00:10:08,614 --> 00:10:10,354
And three that fail.

351
00:10:10,564 --> 00:10:11,674
The three that decide

352
00:10:11,714 --> 00:10:13,894
your old age: the income,

353
00:10:13,934 --> 00:10:15,334
the timing, and who

354
00:10:15,374 --> 00:10:16,714
carries the risk.

355
00:10:16,854 --> 00:10:19,724
As advice, it fails its own test.

356
00:10:20,734 --> 00:10:22,544
Maybe one day he'll be right.

357
00:10:22,824 --> 00:10:24,764
That future would be worth having.

358
00:10:25,014 --> 00:10:26,274
But someone has to pay

359
00:10:26,314 --> 00:10:27,784
for the years in between.

360
00:10:27,964 --> 00:10:29,214
Until a law does,

361
00:10:29,254 --> 00:10:30,944
that someone is you.

362
00:10:31,184 --> 00:10:32,564
Saving was never a bet

363
00:10:32,604 --> 00:10:33,884
against the future.

364
00:10:33,934 --> 00:10:35,434
It's the bridge to it.

365
00:10:35,984 --> 00:10:37,054
This channel exists

366
00:10:37,094 --> 00:10:38,364
for one reason:

367
00:10:38,494 --> 00:10:39,374
so that the arrival

368
00:10:39,414 --> 00:10:40,734
of superintelligence goes

369
00:10:40,774 --> 00:10:41,874
well for everybody,

370
00:10:41,914 --> 00:10:44,194
and everybody makes it across.

371
00:10:44,334 --> 00:10:45,304
Want that too?

372
00:10:45,344 --> 00:10:46,444
Then subscribe.

